     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "In Friedman’s view, a company’s social responsibility consists of enhancing stockholder value."
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "Milton Friedman’s view and position advocated for free-market capitalism. His famous quote was “a society that puts equality ahead of freedom gets neither. A society that puts freedom before equality will get a high degree of both.” In other words, he believed that freedom of choices, options, or the ability to choose will provide the best market conditions, rather than a society that has government controls that dictate what you can and cannot have."
    }
   ],
